{"s":[[null,1,[["g",[["Winter.png",48,[]]]],["p",["Winter is the fourth ",["l","季节","season"]," in ",["l","Stardew Valley","Stardew Valley"],". It is followed by ",["l","春季","Spring"]," and preceded by ",["l","秋季","Fall"],"."]],["p",["Winter is unique amongst the seasons in that no outdoors ",["l","农作物","Crops"],", apart from ",["l","霜瓜种子","Powdermelon Seeds"],", ",["l","冬季种子","Winter Seeds"]," and ",["l","纤维种子","Fiber Seeds"],", will grow, and all ",["l","杂草","Weeds"]," and most tilled soil (including all fertilizer, even if the tile remains tilled) will all be removed at the start of the season. ",["l","草","Grass"]," remains but does not spread. ",["l","蜂房","Bee House"],"s will also not produce ",["l","蜂蜜","honey"]," during winter. Finally, standard ",["l","树","trees"],", including those planted on the farm (except fruit trees) do not grow in winter unless ",["l","树肥","Tree Fertilizer"]," is applied."]],["p",["Overall, with plant growth stopped, Winter can become a challenging season for farmers, leaving only ",["l","动物","animal"]," produce and the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"]," as the mainstay of farm produce. However, the reduced intensity of farming makes it an excellent season for other activities, including ",["l","采集","foraging"],", ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],"/",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," exploration, ",["l","钓鱼","fishing"],", digging at ",["l","远古斑点","artifact spots"],", and gift-giving - with nine birthdays, Winter is tied with ",["l","夏季","Summer"]," for most birthdays in a season. It also makes it easier to obtain ",["l","农场","Farm"]," and ",["l","工具","Tool"]," upgrades without impacting normal routines."]],["p",["Animals require additional care during this season, as they cannot go outside due to the cold. Providing them with a ",["l","加热器","Heater"]," will also make them happier. Additionally, due to the lack of grass and weeds, ",["l","纤维","Fiber"]," and ",["l","干草","Hay"]," are more difficult to obtain outdoors. However fiber still can be found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and ",["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"],", or alternatively grown with ",["l","纤维种子","Fiber Seeds"],". Hay can be purchased from ",["l","玛妮的牧场","Marnie's Ranch"],", or randomly gifted from ",["l","玛妮","her"]," in the mail. It can also be obtained as a byproduct of ",["l","小麦","Wheat"]," grown in the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"],"."]],["p",["There are several winter events and ",["l","节日","festivals"]," which give the player unique opportunities to acquire items. One takes place early in the month and one takes place towards the end, marking the end of the year in the Valley. Additional ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," and ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," activities occur halfway through the season."]]]],["Events",2,[]],["Festivals",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Day"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]}],[["08"],[["f","Calendar_Flag_Anim.gif",32]," ",["l","冰雪节","Festival of Ice"]]],[["12–13"],[["f","Hook_Icon.png",20]," ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]]],[["15–17"],[["f","Iridium_Quality.png",24]," ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]]],[["25"],[["f","Calendar_Flag_Anim.gif",32]," ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"]]]]]]],["Birthdays",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Day"]},{"h":1,"v":["Villager"]}],[["01"],[["f","Krobus_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[["03"],[["f","Linus_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"]]],[["07"],[["f","Caroline_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"]]],[["10"],[["f","Sebastian_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]]],[["14"],[["f","Harvey_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","哈维","Harvey"]]],[["17"],[["f","Wizard_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","法师","Wizard"]]],[["20"],[["f","Evelyn_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"]]],[["23"],[["f","Leah_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","莉亚","Leah"]]],[["26"],[["f","Clint_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","克林特","Clint"]]]]]]],["Crops",2,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","农作物#Winter Crops","Crops"]]],["p",["See also: ",["l","耕种#Experience Points","Farming"]]],["p",["The following ",["l","农作物","Crop"]," is the only one that can be grown in Winter. \"Maximum Harvests p